{"remainingRequest":"/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/node_modules/vue-loader/lib/index.js??vue-loader-options!/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/node_modules/iview-loader/index.js??ref--0-2!/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/src/pages/setting/notification/index.vue?vue&type=template&id=5df6efd1&scoped=true","dependencies":[{"path":"/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/src/pages/setting/notification/index.vue","mtime":1736756303541},{"path":"/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/node_modules/cache-loader/dist/cjs.js","mtime":1736756398481},{"path":"/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/node_modules/babel-loader/lib/index.js","mtime":1736756399637},{"path":"/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/node_modules/vue-loader/lib/loaders/templateLoader.js","mtime":1736756376821},{"path":"/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/node_modules/cache-loader/dist/cjs.js","mtime":1736756398481},{"path":"/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/node_modules/vue-loader/lib/index.js","mtime":1736756376753},{"path":"/home/ubuntu/repos/crmeb-java/src/main/resources/static/admin/node_modules/iview-loader/index.js","mtime":1736756399921}],"contextDependencies":[],"result":["\r\n<!-- 消息设置 -->\r\n  <div class=\"message\">\r\n    <div class=\"i-layout-page-header\">\r\n      <!-- <PageHeader class=\"product_tabs\" :title=\"$route.meta.title\">\r\n        <div slot=\"content\">\r\n          \r\n        </div>\r\n      </PageHeader> -->\r\n      <div class=\"table-box\">\r\n        <Card :bordered=\"false\" dis-hover class=\"ivu-mt\">\r\n          <div class=\"new_tab\">\r\n            <Tabs v-model=\"currentTab\" @on-click=\"changeTab\">\r\n              <TabPane\r\n                :label=\"item.label\"\r\n                :name=\"item.value.toString()\"\r\n                v-for=\"(item, index) in headerList\"\r\n                :key=\"index\"\r\n              />\r\n            </Tabs>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <Row type=\"flex\" class=\"mb20\" v-if=\"currentTab==1\">\r\n            <Col>\r\n              <Button\r\n                v-auth=\"['app-wechat-template-sync']\"\r\n                type=\"success\"\r\n                @click=\"syncTemplate\"\r\n                class=\"ml20\"\r\n                >同步小程序订阅消息</Button\r\n              >\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<Button\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  v-auth=\"['app-wechat-wechat-sync']\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  type=\"primary\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  @click=\"wechatTemplate\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  class=\"ml20\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  >同步公众号模板消息</Button\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t>\r\n            </Col>\r\n          </Row>\r\n          <Alert v-if=\"industry\" closable>\r\n            <template slot=\"desc\">\r\n              <!-- <div v-if=\"industry.primary_industry\">\r\n                主营行业：{{\r\n                  industry.primary_industry.first_class\r\n                    ? industry.primary_industry.first_class + \"||\"\r\n                    : industry.primary_industry\r\n                }}\r\n                {{\r\n                  industry.primary_industry.second_class\r\n                    ? industry.primary_industry.second_class\r\n                    : \"\"\r\n                }}\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div v-if=\"industry.secondary_industry\">\r\n                副营行业：{{\r\n                  industry.secondary_industry.first_class\r\n                    ? industry.primary_industry.first_class + \"||\"\r\n                    : industry.primary_industry\r\n                }}\r\n                {{\r\n                  industry.primary_industry.second_class\r\n                    ? industry.primary_industry.second_class\r\n                    : \"\"\r\n                }}\r\n              </div> -->\r\n              <div class=\"alert-wrapper\">\r\n                <div class=\"alert-wrapper-head\">小程序订阅消息</div>\r\n                <div class=\"alert-wrapper-body\">\r\n                  <div>登录微信小程序后台，基本设置，服务类目增加《生活服务 > 百货/超市/便利店》 <span>(否则同步小程序订阅消息会报错)</span></div>\r\n                  <div>同步小程序订阅消息 是在小程序后台未添加订阅消息模板的前提下使用的，会新增一个模板消息并把信息同步过来，如果小程序后台已经添加过的，会跳过不会更新本项目数据库。</div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"alert-wrapper\">\r\n                <div class=\"alert-wrapper-head\">微信模板消息</div>\r\n                <div class=\"alert-wrapper-body\">\r\n                  <div>登录微信公众号后台，选择模板消息，在账号详情下的服务类目中手动设置服务类目，《生活服务 > 百货/超市/便利店 商业服务 > 软件/建站/技术开发 商家自营 > 办公/文具》 <span>(否则同步模板消息不成功)</span></div>\r\n                  <div>同步公众号模板消息 同步公众号模板会删除公众号后台现有的模板，并重新添加新的模板，然后同步信息到数据库，如果多个项目使用同一个公众号的模板，请谨慎操作。</div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </template>\r\n          </Alert>\r\n          <Table\r\n            :columns=\"columns\"\r\n            :data=\"levelLists\"\r\n            ref=\"table\"\r\n            class=\"mt25\"\r\n            :loading=\"loading\"\r\n            highlight-row\r\n            no-userFrom-text=\"暂无数据\"\r\n            no-filtered-userFrom-text=\"暂无筛选结果\"\r\n          >\r\n            <template slot-scope=\"{ row, index }\" slot=\"name\">\r\n              <span class=\"table\">\r\n                {{ row.name }}\r\n              </span>\r\n            </template>\r\n            <template slot-scope=\"{ row, index }\" slot=\"title\">\r\n              <span class=\"table\">{{ row.title }}</span>\r\n            </template>\r\n            <template\r\n              slot-scope=\"{ row, index }\"\r\n              v-for=\"(item, index) in [\r\n                'is_system',\r\n                'is_wechat',\r\n                'is_routine',\r\n                'is_sms',\r\n                'is_ent_wechat',\r\n              ]\"\r\n              :slot=\"item\"\r\n            >\r\n              <i-switch\r\n                v-model=\"row[item]\"\r\n                :value=\"row[item]\"\r\n                :true-value=\"1\"\r\n                :false-value=\"2\"\r\n                @on-change=\"changeSwitch(row, item)\"\r\n                size=\"large\"\r\n                v-if=\"row[item] > 0\"\r\n              >\r\n                <span slot=\"open\">开启</span>\r\n                <span slot=\"close\">关闭</span>\r\n              </i-switch>\r\n            </template>\r\n            <template slot-scope=\"{ row, index }\" slot=\"setting\">\r\n              <span class=\"setting btn\" @click=\"setting(item, row)\">设置</span>\r\n            </template>\r\n          </Table>\r\n        </Card>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n",null]}